// Italian Aircraft Characteristics (§4.44b, PDF p.144). Fighters (F S R D) + Bombers/Flying Boats/
// Transports/Recon (D R B Transport). TacAir parenthesized on the bomber chart => no_air_to_air.
// Bomb "x/Ty" => bombload x + torpedo y. Mission symbols: No=`.` Day=`!` Night=`N` etc.
{
    // --- Fighters & Fighter-Bombers ---
